---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About | CivicConnect" description="Learn about the purpose, goals, and principles behind the CivicConnect platform.">
  <div class="container section max-w-4xl">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-14 max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight text-foreground leading-[1.15] mb-4">
        About CivicConnect. Democratizing civic access.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        Making Indian constitutional rights, statutory acts, and government entitlements understandable and accessible to every citizen.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content Sections -->
    <div class="space-y-12">
      <article class="card space-y-4">
        <span class="badge badge-soft" data-tone="primary">The Barrier</span>
        <h2 class="text-h2 text-2xl">The Complexity Barrier</h2>
        <p class="text-body text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          India has a rich legislative framework and thousands of welfare schemes designed to support citizens. However, finding, interpreting, and benefiting from these resources is often hindered by complex legal language, fragmented websites, and bureaucratic barriers.
        </p>
        <p class="text-body text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          As a result, many eligible citizens remain unaware of their entitlements, and ordinary people struggle to find accurate answers to everyday civil questions (such as deadlines for filing requests, consumer protection rights, or state pensions).
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card space-y-4">
        <span class="badge badge-soft" data-tone="accent">Our Approach</span>
        <h2 class="text-h2 text-2xl">Democratizing Civic Information</h2>
        <p class="text-body text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          CivicConnect bridges this gap by combining modern AI assistance with strict retrieval mechanisms. We believe that citizens shouldn't need a legal degree to understand their basic rights or check their eligibility for government aid.
        </p>
        <p class="text-body text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          By translating complex legal terminology into simple, direct explanations—while always providing official supporting citations—we empower citizens with verified knowledge they can rely on.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card space-y-4">
        <span class="badge badge-soft" data-tone="warning">Reliability First</span>
        <h2 class="text-h2 text-2xl">Citations Over Hallucinations</h2>
        <p class="text-body text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          Generic AI tools can frequently generate convincing but fabricated legal advice. CivicConnect does not generate answers out of thin air. 
        </p>
        <p class="text-body text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          Every response produced by the system is generated <em>only</em> from verified, retrieved source files from official gazettes and portals. If a source document cannot be found, the system informs you, rather than fabricating a response.
        </p>
      </article>

      <!-- Disclaimer notice -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-ui-lg border border-border bg-muted/60 space-y-2">
        <h3 class="font-medium text-base text-foreground">Notice of Independence</h3>
        <p class="text-small text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          CivicConnect is an independent civic information tool. It is not affiliated with the Government of India or any state government. The platform provides simplified guidance and is not a substitute for formal, professional advice from certified legal counsel.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
